            <ArticleTitle>New tool to tackle Alzheimer's disease: amyloid-β protofibril-selective antibody AbSL: An Editorial Highlight for 'The conformational epitope for a new Aβ42 protofibril-selective antibody partially overlaps with the peptide N-terminal region' on page 736.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
